WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.062
Let’s walk through Sessions.

00:00:02.062 --> 00:00:05.275
Create or select the intended run and verify its name

00:00:05.275 --> 00:00:07.812
and join code before distribution.

00:00:07.812 --> 00:00:11.775
Preserve archived and inactive sessions as evidence without allowing them

00:00:11.775 --> 00:00:14.512
to become the accidental live context.

00:00:14.512 --> 00:00:17.413
On this slide, create the session, assign its

00:00:17.413 --> 00:00:20.550
join code, select the active run, and preserve

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:22.663
the list for operator handoff.

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:26.473
In practice, verify the session name and code before

00:00:26.473 --> 00:00:28.135
distributing access;

00:00:28.135 --> 00:00:31.835
an archived or different session must not become the accidental

00:00:31.835 --> 00:00:33.285
live context.

00:00:33.285 --> 00:00:36.010
When you are ready, use Open Sessions to move

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:37.697
to the live surface.

00:00:37.697 --> 00:00:40.560
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:40.710
.
